  "published": "2026-09-13T22:47:20.897Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "CliRun is stateless: UseExternalProcessFactory and UseFilePathResolver removed; each call allocates fresh pipeline\nExternalProcess sealed\nProcessConfigurationBuilder sealed, positioned for advanced scenarios only\nAddCliInvoke moved here from CliInvoke.Specializations (namespace unchanged). Chain .AddCliInvokeSpecializations() for middleware.\nAddCliInvoke overload with configure callback\nBuilt-in middleware registered in AddCliInvoke so UseMiddleware<T>() resolves them\nProcessMiddlewareBuilder (public) with UseMiddleware/UseWhen\nOutput truncation middleware, CachingFilePathResolver, retry middleware, logging middleware, post-exit validation middleware\nmaxBufferedOutputBytes on CliRun buffered path\nCliInvoke.Extensions folded in; dead IVT grants stripped\nLocalization resources\nConfigureAwait(false) enforced on every await in src\nPer-call allocation reductions in result parsing and argument building",
